<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 561 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 561 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board of Trade Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totalled 561 contracts compared with 437 overnight Sunday, according to the CBOT.</p>
<p>There were 129 wheat, 378 corn, 53 soybean and one soybean call traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was one to 3-1/4 cents per bushel lower, corn was unchanged to 1-1/2 cents lower and soybeans were steady to 1/4 cent higher.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
